Bodybuilder RPG
Created by Gavin Dennis

A JPRG-inspired role playing game featuring bodybuilding simulator
elements and a conditional turn-based battle system in the style of Final Fantasy X.

Important Updates
    2025-07-06
        First playable demo is now available!
        "Bodybuilder RPG/Build/Demo 2025-07-06.zip"
        All you need to do is download it, unzip it, and run the executable.
        The overworld is pretty empty, but you can experience the dialog and battle
        systems as well as the first part of the main story.

